Keycloak is distributed under the Apache License 2.0. The licence text is
LICENSE.txt, in this directory.

The Keycloak version in this image is named in /usr/lib/keycloak/version.txt.
Its source code is the tag of that version in
  https://github.com/keycloak/keycloak
and the Rasputin OS source bundle for this release carries the same source
archive.

The jars under /usr/lib/keycloak/lib each carry their own licence and notice
files inside them, under META-INF/. Jars offered under the GNU GPL or LGPL
(alone, with an exception, or as one choice of a dual licence) have their
-sources.jar from Maven Central in the Rasputin OS source bundle for this
release.

Rasputin ships the upstream release unmodified, except that kc.sh build has
been run on it at image build time with the options in
/usr/share/rasputin/identity/keycloak-build.conf.
